    "Yemen’s Houthis claimed Wednesday they attacked Saudi Arabia’s largest oil refinery at Ras Tanura. Satellite images from NASA and Planet Labs showed heavy smoke over the facility, and a source familiar with the matter confirmed the attack to Reuters.",
